<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Creating_a_new_module_to_work_in">Creating a new module to work in</span></h2>
<p>You should always create a new module to do the majority of your work in the DA Toolset. The only time you should work in the Single Player module (which is what the Origins Campaign is called in the toolset database) is when building new levels; this is required due to a bug in how levels are packaged by the toolset.
</p>
